<Base title="About" crumb="About">
  <article class="article prose">
    <h1 class="anton" style="font-size:clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px)">Hi. I'm Ava.</h1>
    <p>I'm 22, I'm a girl, and I have watched more football than your group chat combined.</p>
    <p>Pretty Baller is football and all things sports from a perspective the booth doesn't have: young, female, and not interested in hedging. Four things, every week.</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Who's Sweating?</strong> The hot seat, every Monday. Coaches, owners, front offices and fanbases, with temperature readings.</li>
      <li><strong>What I'm Standing On.</strong> My picks and previews, in writing, before kickoff. The record stays up.</li>
      <li><strong>The Group Chat.</strong> What's actually going on in the building: chemistry, falling-outs, and the personal stuff, when it explains the football.</li>
      <li><strong>The Morning After.</strong> Every game recapped before your coffee's done, plus the three things I can't stop thinking about.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Smart first. Funny second. Receipts kept in public.</p>
    <p>Say hi on <a href="https://instagram.com/prettyballersports">Instagram</a> or <a href="https://tiktok.com/@prettyballersports">TikTok</a>. Podcast coming soon.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
